# Product Images Placeholder

This directory is for product images. 

## Image Naming Convention

Product images should be named according to the product slug:
- essential-oversized-t-shirt.jpg
- heavyweight-oversized-t-shirt.jpg
- signature-wide-leg-sweatpants.jpg
- essential-hoodie.jpg
- studio-heavyweight-sweatshirt.jpg

## Adding Images

1. Place your product images in this directory
2. Name them according to the product slug
3. Update the seed script or database to reference the correct image URLs

## Future Integration

This structure is designed to easily integrate with:
- Cloudinary
- AWS S3
- Supabase Storage
- Or any other image hosting service

Simply update the image URLs in the database to point to your chosen service.